 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-3.5\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"font-body text-sm text-muted hover:text-ink transition-colors\">Sign in</a><a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"font-body text-sm font-semibold bg-brand-gold text-brand-black rounded-full px-[22px] py-[11px] shadow-[0_4px_18px_rgba(245,166,35,0.20)] hover:bg-brand-gold-dim transition-all\">Start free</a></div><div class=\"md:hidden flex items-center gap-2\"><button class=\"text-ink\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></nav><main class=\"bg-ground text-ink min-h-screen\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Channels\",\"item\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/channels\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"SMS\",\"item\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/channels/sms\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"SMS marketing\",\"description\":\"SMS as a fallback when other channels go quiet, and for time-sensitive alerts, with replies routed into the same conversation thread.\",\"serviceType\":\"Marketing service\",\"url\":\"https://nebulaa.ai/channels/sms\",\"provider\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Nebulaa\",\"url\":\"https://nebulaa.ai\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"India\"}}</script><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] pt-[130px] pb-[80px]\"><nav class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12.5px] text-faint mb-8\"><a class=\"hover:text-gold-text\" href=\"/channels\">Channels</a><span>/</span><span class=\"text-muted\">SMS</span></nav><div class=\"max-w-[880px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-[24px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold \">Channel · SMS</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-muted border border-rule rounded-full px-2.5 py-1\">Handled by Pulsar</span></div><h1 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[38px] md:text-[58px] leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.02em] mb-[26px]\" style=\"text-wrap:pretty\">Still the one that<!-- --> <span class=\"italic text-gold-display\">always gets seen.</span></h1><p class=\"text-[17.5px] leading-[1.65] text-muted max-w-[640px] mb-9\">SMS has no algorithm and almost universal reach, which makes it the right fallback for a customer who has not opened WhatsApp in three days — and for anything genuinely time-sensitive.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold text-[#1A1208] text-[15px] font-semibold px-[28px] py-[14px] rounded-full hover:brightness-105 transition\" href=\"/pricing\">Start free trial<!-- --> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,400px)_minmax(0,1fr)] gap-x-[80px] gap-y-10\"><div><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[20px] block\">What we do here</span><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[30px] md:text-[40px] leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.02em]\">On this channel, <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">specifically.</span></h2></div><div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 border-b border-rule pb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Fallback when a WhatsApp or email thread goes quiet</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 border-b border-rule pb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Time-sensitive alerts, confirmations and reminders</span></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3.5 border-b border-rule pb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check text-gold-text flex-shrink-0 mt-[3px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"></path></svg><span class=\"text-[15.5px] leading-[1.6] text-ink-2\">Replies routed back into the same conversation thread</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-7 bg-surface-2 border border-rule rounded-[12px] p-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-info text-muted flex-shrink-0 mt-[2px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-[14px] leading-[1.6] text-muted\">Best as a fallback and for time-sensitive messages rather than as a primary channel. Used badly, SMS reads as spam faster than anything else.</p></div></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><div class=\"max-w-[640px] mb-[44px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[20px] block\">Questions</span><h2 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[30px] md:text-[42px] leading-[1.14] tracking-[-0.02em]\">About this channel, <span class=\"italic text-gold-text\">honestly.</span></h2></div><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Will this annoy people?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"It would, if used for everything. It is a fallback channel and a time-sensitive one, which is why it sits behind WhatsApp rather than beside it.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does it work with DLT registration?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Indian SMS requires DLT-registered sender IDs and templates. That gets set up during onboarding.\"}}]}</script><div class=\"max-w-[820px]\"><div class=\"border-b border-rule transition-all duration-200 pl-0\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 text-left cursor-pointer group gap-4\"><span class=\"font-heading text-[18px] font-medium text-ink group-hover:text-gold-text transition-colors\">Will this annoy people?</span><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></button></div><div class=\"border-b border-rule transition-all duration-200 pl-0\"><button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"w-full flex items-center justify-between py-5 text-left cursor-pointer group gap-4\"><span class=\"font-heading text-[18px] font-medium text-ink group-hover:text-gold-text transition-colors\">Does it work with DLT registration?</span><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down text-gold-text\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></div></button></div></div></section><hr class=\"border-t border-rule\"/><section class=\"px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px] py-[100px]\"><span class=\"neb-label neb-label-gold mb-[26px] block\">Related channels</span><div class=\"grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5\"><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[26px] pt-[28px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/channels/whatsapp\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">WhatsApp</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-4\">Where the enquiry actually arrives — answered in minutes, not Monday.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[26px] pt-[28px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/channels/email\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Email</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-4\">Handled in the same thread as WhatsApp, with the same qualification.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group block bg-surface border border-rule rounded-[18px] px-[26px] pt-[28px] pb-7 hover:border-gold/30 transition-colors\" href=\"/channels/voice\"><h3 class=\"font-heading font-medium text-[19px] mb-2.5\">Voice calling</h3><p class=\"text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-muted mb-4\">A managed call queue for the enquiries a message will not close.</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-gold-text group-hover:gap-2.5 transition-all\">Read <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></section></main><footer class=\"relative border-t border-rule pt-[60px] pb-[50px] px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-[120px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-start justify-between gap-[50px] lg:gap-[70px]\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-[10px] mb-4\"><div class=\"w-[17px] h-[17px] rounded-full flex-shrink-0\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(circle at 34% 32%, #FFD48A 0%, #F5A623 46%, #A4650B 100%)\"></div><span class=\"font-heading text-[17px] font-normal text-ink\">Nebulaa</span></div><div class=\"font-body text-[13px] text-muted leading-[1.7]\">Chennai, India<br/><a href=\"mailto:hello@nebulaa.ai\" class=\"hover:text-gold-text transition-colors\">hello@nebulaa.ai</a></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-x-[70px